        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n9. Perusal of the pleadings, documents placed on record as also considering the submission of learned counsel for respective parties, it is appearing that petitioners are running restaurant in the name and style of M/s. Ashoka Biryani at d"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "63da434eae75466daa503527e29085aa_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "On 18.04.2024 two of the employees of petitioners while cleaning sewerage died, concerned police station was given morgue intimation and on 19.04.2024 and 20.04.2024, the restaurant run by petitioners at different locations were sealed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "29fac0cee3fc42edbd32f1bcbc6b8985_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The main ground raised by learned counsel for petitioners is that the act of sealing of restaurants of petitioners by officials of Municipal Corporation and State administration is without jurisdiction and without authority of law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "16c890afb47649839065ff30bd44c86a_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "When the query is posed to learned counsel for respective respondents as to under which provisions of law, the restaurant run by petitioners were sealed, they only submitted that upon joint inspection they found that there is no proper fire"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d16f09ebced649a0992ebe2f9b3b1f22_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the panchnama which is placed on record by learned State counsel, prepared at the time of joint inspection would show that kitchen and washroom were in unhygienic conditions, however, it is not specifically mentioned in the panchnama tha"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "98f552ef591b4453ac5a3e8f7f662de1_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is no specific mention in this regard."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d0994590c2fb41cebea758dbba6e378c_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "With respect to no proper place of parking also or not having fire safety measures no show cause notice was issued to petitioners before sealing the premises by the competent authority providing opportunity of hearing."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0a74854ec5aa4398b1949cffff6d3a72_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. It is not a case of respondents that petitioners was running the business without having any prior permission or license for running the restaurant."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "882251d74741495d82f615de811f9c6c_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Apart from the aforementioned two points, which was noted in the panchanama that kitchen and washroom were in unhygienic condition and no proper place of parking is available, the inspection team recorded that there was no fire safety measu"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fd99cfedd14a45cbba41eac35b9f1d41_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. For the forgoing discussions made here-in-above this Court is of the view that the action on the part of the respondents authorities of sealing the shops of petitioners is per-se arbitrary and illegal,\ntherefore, the respondents are dir"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8d2932b5a6ea445e9f18dce936edffdd_36",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However,\nthe respondents are at liberty to take action against petitioners for violation of the conditions of license, any order or law, if any, after following due process of law and after giving show cause notice M/S Ashoka Biryani vs Sta"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bbb5bed72c0b47e6bdad5c0f11adc098_37",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
